taTFJ"><table class="N3pCj"><tr><td class="Kee1sc"><div>   <div>       <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad">2023年7月13日</span>  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad"> · </span>  <span class="fYyStc">... 人工智能创新发展，对生成式人工智能服务实行包容审慎和分类分级监管。 第四条提供和使用生成式人工智能服务，应当遵守法律、行政法规，尊重社会公德 ...</span>  </span>       </div>  </div></td></tr></table></div></div></div> </div> </div><div> <div> <div class="zMzFAb"><div><div><a class="fuLhoc ZWRArf" href="/url?q=https://www.ndrc.gov.cn/wsdwhfz/202512/t20251203_1402185.html&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQFnoECAUQAg&amp;usg=AOvVaw1gz05miNQo1-i0CC3lTrJS"><span class="CVA68e qXLe6d fuLhoc ZWRArf">人工智能安全治理的国际经验和启示</span>  <span class="qXLe6d dXDvrc">  <span class="fYyStc">www.ndrc.gov.cn › wsdwhfz</span>  </span> </a></div><div class="taTFJ"><table class="N3pCj"><tr><td class="Kee1sc"><div>   <div>       <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad">2025年12月3日</span>  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad"> · </span>  <span class="fYyStc">全球政策制定者加大监管力度，加速建立硬性法律约束和完善的风险防控体系：美联邦机构在2024年出台了59项人工智能相关法规，是2023年的两倍多，日本发布《 ...</span>  </span>       </div>  </div></td></tr></table></div></div></div> </div> </div><div> <div> <div class="zMzFAb"><div><div><a class="fuLhoc ZWRArf" href="/url?q=https://www.ciis.org.cn/gjwtyj/dqqk/202505/P020250512583201774405.pdf&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQFnoECAcQAg&amp;usg=AOvVaw3PC9Z_ZI1EjM3jVr2Fkcpv"><span class="CVA68e qXLe6d fuLhoc ZWRArf">[PDF] 欧盟寻求人工智能监管规则型领导地位： 认知与路径*</span>  <span class="qXLe6d dXDvrc">  <span class="fYyStc">www.ciis.org.cn › gjwtyj › dqqk</span>  </span> </a></div><div class="taTFJ"><table class="N3pCj"><tr><td class="Kee1sc"><div>   <div>       <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <span class="fYyStc">随着数字技术崛起与人工智能跃迁，人工智能监管与数字领导地位密切. 关联，不少强势竞争者都在积极寻求人工智能监管规则的主导权。譬如，英. 国成立人工智能基础模型工作 ...</span>  </span>       </div>  </div></td></tr></table></div></div></div> </div> </div><div> <div> <div class="zMzFAb"><div><div><a class="fuLhoc ZWRArf" href="/url?q=https://www.secrss.com/articles/89612&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQFnoECAYQAg&amp;usg=AOvVaw3geNjKN_Eyj6LaD0QahSpT"><span class="CVA68e qXLe6d fuLhoc ZWRArf">中国人工智能监管法规全景解析 - 安全内参</span>  <span class="qXLe6d dXDvrc">  <span class="fYyStc">www.secrss.com › articles</span>  </span> </a></div><div class="taTFJ"><table class="N3pCj"><tr><td class="Kee1sc"><div>   <div>       <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad">2026年4月21日</span>  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad"> · </span>  <span class="fYyStc">随着生成式人工智能技术的爆发式发展，中国监管层在《网络安全法》《数据安全法》《个人信息保护法》等基本法律框架下，针对不同AI应用场景发布了一系列 ...</span>  </span>       </div>  </div></td></tr></table></div></div></div> </div> </div><div> <div> <div class="zMzFAb"><div><div><a class="fuLhoc ZWRArf" href="/url?q=https://www.nfra.gov.cn/cn/view/pages/governmentDetail.html%3FdocId%3D1261784%26itemId%3D%26generaltype%3D1&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQFnoECAkQAg&amp;usg=AOvVaw3c6hh5A0Kq56BYXIStpnPm"><span class="CVA68e qXLe6d fuLhoc ZWRArf">关于银行业保险业人工智能安全开发应用的指导意见</span>  <span class="qXLe6d dXDvrc">  <span class="fYyStc">www.nfra.gov.cn › view › pages › governmentDetail</span>  </span> </a></div><div class="taTFJ"><table class="N3pCj"><tr><td class="Kee1sc"><div>   <div>       <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad">2026年6月18日</span>  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad"> · </span>  <span class="fYyStc">金融机构应将人工智能风险纳入全面风险管理体系，定期开展对人工智能应用风险及管理措施的评估审查。推动模型算法、数据资源、基础设施、应用系统等安全 ...</span>  </span>       </div>  </div></td></tr></table></div></div></div> </div> </div><div> <div> <div class="zMzFAb"><div><div><a class="fuLhoc ZWRArf" href="/url?q=https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hans/%25E4%25BA%25BA%25E5%25B7%25A5%25E6%2599%25BA%25E8%2583%25BD%25E7%259B%2591%25E7%25AE%25A1&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQFnoECAgQAg&amp;usg=AOvVaw0H_9B_vwXOv93xPAiD4aYg"><span class="CVA68e qXLe6d fuLhoc ZWRArf">人工智能监管- 维基百科，自由的百科全书</span>  <span class="qXLe6d dXDvrc">  <span class="fYyStc">zh.wikipedia.org › zh-hans › 人工智能监管</span>  </span> </a></div><div class="taTFJ"><table class="N3pCj"><tr><td class="Kee1sc"><div>   <div>       <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <span class="fYyStc">人工智能监管是指公共部门为促进和规范人工智能而制定的政策与法律。在全球各司法管辖区，包括像IEEE或OECD这样没有直接执法权的国际组织，人工智能的监管与政策格局都是 ...</span>  </span>        <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <a class="M3vVJe" href="/url?q=https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hans/%25E4%25BA%25BA%25E5%25B7%25A5%25E6%2599%25BA%25E8%2583%25BD%25E7%259B%2591%25E7%25AE%25A1%23%25E8%2583%258C%25E6%2599%25AF&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQ0gJ6BAgIEAU&amp;usg=AOvVaw0T5aSOcgN_aTYuenGM8nPj">背景</a>  <span class="fYyStc"> · </span>  <a class="M3vVJe" href="/url?q=https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hans/%25E4%25BA%25BA%25E5%25B7%25A5%25E6%2599%25BA%25E8%2583%25BD%25E7%259B%2591%25E7%25AE%25A1%23%25E8%25A7%2582%25E7%2582%25B9&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQ0gJ6BAgIEAY&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eg1nzVPckXxoLsJhUBUye">观点</a>  <span class="fYyStc"> · </span>  <a class="M3vVJe" href="/url?q=https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hans/%25E4%25BA%25BA%25E5%25B7%25A5%25E6%2599%25BA%25E8%2583%25BD%25E7%259B%2591%25E7%25AE%25A1%23%25E5%2585%25A8%25E7%2590%2583%25E6%258C%2587%25E5%25AF%25BC&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQ0gJ6BAgIEAc&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CujGekZYJDot4u5O4Zj0c">全球指导</a>  <span class="fYyStc"> · </span>  <a class="M3vVJe" href="/url?q=https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hans/%25E4%25BA%25BA%25E5%25B7%25A5%25E6%2599%25BA%25E8%2583%25BD%25E7%259B%2591%25E7%25AE%25A1%23%25E5%258C%25BA%25E5%259F%259F%25E4%25B8%258E%25E5%259B%25BD%25E5%25AE%25B6%25E7%259B%2591%25E7%25AE%25A1&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQ0gJ6BAgIEAg&amp;usg=AOvVaw3FmDkGYX_2jY9xrwZbsNfS">区域与国家监管</a>  </span>       </div>  </div></td></tr></table></div></div></div> </div> </div><div> <div> <div class="zMzFAb"><div><div><a class="fuLhoc ZWRArf" href="/url?q=https://journal.bjut.edu.cn/bjgydxxbskb/article/doi/10.12120/bjutskxb202503019&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQFnoECBcQAg&amp;usg=AOvVaw10bfOik1Ufo1wyeiqID5Xh"><span class="CVA68e qXLe6d fuLhoc ZWRArf">加强人工智能监管与治理 - 北京工业大学学报</span>  <span class="qXLe6d dXDvrc">  <span class="fYyStc">journal.bjut.edu.cn › bjgydxxbskb › article › doi › bjutskxb202503019</span>  </span> </a></div><div class="taTFJ"><table class="N3pCj"><tr><td class="Kee1sc"><div>   <div>       <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <span class="fYyStc">加强人工智能监管治理需结合人工智能技术发展特点，及时更新监管制度，创新监管方式，主要措施有：推进基于风险的监管方式，实行敏捷监管，推进“软法”与“硬法”协同监管， ...</span>  </span>       </div>  </div></td></tr></table></div></div></div> </div> </div><div> <div> <div class="zMzFAb"><div><div><a class="fuLhoc ZWRArf" href="/url?q=https://www.junhe.com/legal-updates/2948&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQFnoECBgQAg&amp;usg=AOvVaw03E1Fs3om2dY77-OkDARZJ"><span class="CVA68e qXLe6d fuLhoc ZWRArf">2025年全球人工智能监管回顾 - 君合</span>  <span class="qXLe6d dXDvrc">  <span class="fYyStc">www.junhe.com › legal-updates</span>  </span> </a></div><div class="taTFJ"><table class="N3pCj"><tr><td class="Kee1sc"><div>   <div>       <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad">2026年4月2日</span>  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad"> · </span>  <span class="fYyStc">2025年全球人工智能监管回顾 · 一、欧盟《人工智能法案》第一批规则已生效；针对高风险人工智能系统的规则即将生效 · 二、人工智能配套指南和行为准则密集 ...</span>  </span>       </div>  </div></td></tr></table></div></div></div> </div> </div><div> <div> <div class="zMzFAb"><div><div><a class="fuLhoc ZWRArf" href="/url?q=https://cas.fudan.edu.cn/info/1039/32323.htm&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQFnoECAoQAg&amp;usg=AOvVaw2kz7dk2zqT4zpyiSvRIskr"><span class="CVA68e qXLe6d fuLhoc ZWRArf">精准把握人工智能监管治理的尺度-复旦美国研究中心</span>  <span class="qXLe6d dXDvrc">  <span class="fYyStc">cas.fudan.edu.cn › info</span>  </span> </a></div><div class="taTFJ"><table class="N3pCj"><tr><td class="Kee1sc"><div>   <div>       <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad">8天前</span>  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad"> · </span>  <span class="fYyStc">首先，要做到监管对象精准，坚持风险导向和分类分级。人工智能不是单一技术，不同技术形态、应用场景的风险性质、影响范围和潜在损害存在明显差异。基础 ...</span>  </span>       </div>  </div></td></tr></table></div></div></div> </div> </div><div> <div> <div class="zMzFAb"><div><div><a class="fuLhoc ZWRArf" href="/url?q=https://cn.linkedin.com/pulse/thoughts-ai-regulation-patricia-thaine-x2ubc%3Ftl%3Dzh&amp;sa=U&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQFnoECAwQAg&amp;usg=AOvVaw0c0-PWosrTbcqOTgL4sseB"><span class="CVA68e qXLe6d fuLhoc ZWRArf">关于人工智能监管的看法 - 领英</span>  <span class="qXLe6d dXDvrc">  <span class="fYyStc">cn.linkedin.com › pulse</span>  </span> </a></div><div class="taTFJ"><table class="N3pCj"><tr><td class="Kee1sc"><div>   <div>       <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad">2023年11月2日</span>  <span class="fYyStc YVIcad"> · </span>  <span class="fYyStc">正确实施的人工智能监管不会阻止新的小型参与者进入市场。 · 拥抱GDPR的公司现在对其系统中存在哪些类型的数据以及相关风险有了更全面的理解 · 虽然在2018年 ...</span>  </span>       </div>  </div></td></tr></table></div></div></div> </div> </div><div> <div> <div class="zMzFAb"><div><div>  <span class="qXLe6d x3G5ab">  <span class="dloBPe fYyStc">相关搜索</span>  </span> </div><div><table class="HExoMb"><tbody><tr><td><a class="ZWRArf" href="/search?lr=lang_zh-CN&amp;cr=countryCN&amp;sca_esv=1&amp;hl=zh-CN&amp;ie=UTF-8&amp;oe=UTF-8&amp;tbs=lr:lang_1zh-CN,ctr:countryCN&amp;sxsrf=APpeQnsrKc8HZIfOH5hfSLVSqs3dZtAI7g:1790657134249&amp;q=%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%8A%9E%E6%B3%95&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi735rT_ZKXAxVasCsGHQd4J3cQ1QJ6BAgLEAE"><span class="CVA68e qXLe6d">  <span class="qXLe6d FrIlee">  <span class="fYyStc">人工智能管理办法</span>  </span> </span></a></td><td><div class="FiGnM"><a href="/search?lr=lang_zh-CN&amp;cr=countryCN&amp;sca_esv=1&amp;hl=zh-CN&amp;ie=UTF-8&amp;oe=UTF-8&amp;tbs=lr:lang_1zh-CN,ctr:countryCN&amp;sxsrf=APpeQnsrKc8HZIfOH5hfSLVSqs3dZtAI7g:1790657134249&amp;q=%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%8A%9E%E6%B3%95"><div class="FrIlee">&gt;</div></a></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><tab